  "details": "Each website should have a recognisable purpose title and a unique icon or consistent graphic.\n\nLet's summarise:\n\n- https://hello.vrchat.com has \"VRChat\" title and \"VR\" icon.\n\n- https://vrchat.com/home has\"Home - VRChat\" or \"VRChat - Home\" (it displayed just a moment when the page loads) title and \"VR\" icon.\n\n- https://docs.vrchat.com has \"VRChat\" title and horizontal \"VRC\" icon.\n\n- https://creators.vrchat.com has \"VRChat Creation\" title and \"VR\" icon.\n\n- https://help.vrchat.com has \"VRChat\" title and diagonal \"VRC\" icon.\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com has \"VRChat Feedback\" and diagonal \"VRC\" icon.\n\n- https://ask.vrchat.com has \"VRChat Ask Forum\" title and \"VR\" icon.\n\nSo, there is no consistency and it's hard to understand what kind of page it is just from the title.\n\nI'd like each website to have a unique and recognisable title and its icon to have a unique and consistent graphic.",
